cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "Fly VNC Walking Simulation"
abstract: >
  Closed-loop simulation of the Drosophila male ventral nerve cord driving
  a biomechanical fly in MuJoCo. A dual-timeconstant leaky integrate-and-fire
  network is built directly from the Sept 2026 male-cns:v1.0 connectome
  release (24,115 neurons, 1.7M weighted edges) and coupled to NeuroMechFly v2
  through sensor-motor interfaces. The connectome weights are never modified;
  only a thin command interface is learned.
